  "releaseNotes": "LC045 now reports a navigation read inside a local function handed the entity whose only use of it is reading navigations. Such a callee cannot be the loading mechanism the read needs, so the parameter binds to the argument's origin. Passing the entity on, assigning it, calling through it, or explicitly loading it all keep the argument an escape, as do two call sites.",
